The pipe: |&gt;

|&gt; takes what’s on its left and passes it in as the first argument of the function on its right. Steps now read top-to-bottom, in the order they happen.

penguins |&gt;
  mutate(body_mass_kg = body_mass_g / 1000) |&gt;
  filter(body_mass_kg &lt; 2.8)

